WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.882
The example on the screen is valid jay son, but it is not valid application data.

00:00:05.882 --> 00:00:12.117
The category is “refund,” even though refund is not one of the allowed labels.

00:00:12.117 --> 00:00:19.467
The urgency is the number seven, even though the application expects low, medium, or high.

00:00:19.467 --> 00:00:23.802
A parser only answers whether the syntax is readable.

00:00:23.802 --> 00:00:28.356
Schema and business validation answer whether the data is acceptable.
